{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunisia stands out as one of the most popular tourist destinations in North Africa. While many travelers arrive via Djerba or the modern Enfidha Airport, the historic <strong>Monastir </strong>Airport remains a bustling hub. Serving over 15 domestic and international airlines - most operating seasonally - it continues to play a key role in the region\u2019s tourism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its picturesque approach, stunning beaches, and large hotels just steps away, Monastir offers visitors a charming and convenient getaway that\u2019s well worth exploring!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate and realistic\u00a0rendition of Monastir Habib Bourgiba International Airport, Tunisia\u00a0(DTMB)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated ground layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic light environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X-Plane technologies (dynamic lighting, reflective textures,...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for great performance and\u00a0visual results</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970730?t=1756363219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970730?t=1756363219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970730/bed1aaa6ed84ac2cca0a7e35b6ad9cc24c6dadee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756363219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970730/bed1aaa6ed84ac2cca0a7e35b6ad9cc24c6dadee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756363219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Partial Controller Su